     5.59 0.00414 1350       0

Detection:
 Estimate      SE    z P(>|z|)
     4.39 0.00267 1647       0

AIC: 556243.6

Backtransformed linear combination(s) of Density estimate(s)

 Estimate   SE LinComb (Intercept)
      267 1.11    5.59           1

Thanks,

Matt

